#: includes/settings.php:129
msgid "General"
msgstr "Jikelele"

#: includes/settings.php:136
msgid "API Mode"
msgstr "Imo ye-API"

#: includes/settings.php:142
msgid ""
"Select the API Mode. Use Self-hosted for the built-in WordPress REST API, or "
"Custom to point to your own ALTCHA-compatible backend."
msgstr ""
"Khetha imo ye-API. Sebenzisa i-Self-hosted ukuze usebenzise i-WordPress REST "
"API ekhoyo, okanye i-Custom ukuze ukhokelele kwi-backend yakho ehambelanayo "
"ne-ALTCHA."

#: includes/settings.php:144
msgid "Self-hosted"
msgstr "Self-hosted"

#: includes/settings.php:154
msgid "Challenge URL"
msgstr "I-URL yombuzo"

#: includes/settings.php:162
msgid ""
"Only available when API Mode is set to Custom.<br/>The URL is made up of the "
"domain and path to your <strong>custom ALTCHA-compatible backend</strong>, "
"and optionally an API key (it starts with <code>gk_</code>)."
msgstr ""
"Iyafumaneka kuphela xa imo ye-API isetingwe kwi-Custom.<br/>I-URL yakhiwe "
"nge-domain kunye ne-path ye-<strong>backend yakho ehambelanayo ne-ALTCHA</"
"strong>, kwaye ngokukhetha i-API key (iqala nge-<code>gk_</code>)."

#: includes/settings.php:171
msgid "Shared secret"
msgstr "Isimfihlo esabelwana"

#: includes/settings.php:177
msgid "A secret key used to sign and verify challenges."
msgstr "Ikhodi yimfihlo esetyenziswa ukutshatisa nokuqinisekisa imibuzo."

#: includes/settings.php:178
msgid ""
"OpenPorte generates a random secret automatically. Change it only if another "
"application needs to use the same secret.<br/>In Custom API Mode, this value "
"<strong>must exactly match</strong> the shared secret (sometimes called the "
"HMAC secret) configured in your backend."
msgstr ""
"I-OpenPorte ikhiqiza isimfihlo esingaqikeleleki ngokuzenzekelayo. Sishintshe "
"kuphela ukuba enye i-application idinga ukusebenzisa isimfihlo esifanayo.<br/"
">Kwi-Custom API Mode, eli xabiso <strong>kufuneka lihambelane ngqo</strong> "
"nesimfihlo esabelwana (ngamanye amaxesha sibizwa ngokuba sisimfihlo se-HMAC) "
"esicwangcisiweyo kwi-backend yakho."

#: includes/settings.php:186 includes/settings.php:192
msgid "Hash algorithm for the challenges."
msgstr "I-algorithm ye-hash yemibuzo."

#: includes/settings.php:186
msgid "Algorithm"
msgstr "I-Algorithm"

#: includes/settings.php:193
msgid ""
"In Self-hosted API Mode this is the algorithm used to generate and verify "
"the proof-of-work challenges.<br/>In Custom API Mode it must match the "
"algorithm your backend uses — most ALTCHA-compatible backends default to "
"SHA-256."
msgstr ""
"Kwi-Self-hosted API Mode le yi-algorithm esetyenziswa ukukhiqiza "
"nokuqinisekisa imibuzo ye-proof-of-work.<br/>Kwi-Custom API Mode kufuneka "
"ihambelane ne-algorithm e-backend yakho esiyisebenzisayo — i-backends "
"ezininzi ehambelanayo ne-ALTCHA zisebenzisa i-SHA-256 ngokwemveli."

#: includes/settings.php:203
msgid "Low"
msgstr "Ephantsi"

#: includes/settings.php:204
msgid "Medium"
msgstr "Epakathi"

#: includes/settings.php:205
msgid "High"
msgstr "Ephezulu"

#: includes/settings.php:215
msgid "Complexity"
msgstr "Ubunzima"

#: includes/settings.php:221
msgid ""
"Select the PoW complexity for the widget: the higher the complexity, the "
"longer visitors (and bots) work to solve the challenge.<br/>Even High is "
"usually solved in under a second on a recent computer; on older phones it "
"can take a few seconds. High is roughly 2–3× the work of Low."
msgstr ""
"Khetha ubunzima be-PoW be-widget: ngokuba ubunzima buyanda, kuthatha ixesha "
"elide abavakasheli (kunye neebots) ukusombulula umbuzo.<br/>Nokuba i-High "
"idla ngokusombululwa ngaphantsi kweyure enye kwi-computer entsha; kwiifoni "
"ezindala kungathatha iisekondi ezimbalwa. I-High yimalunga ne-2–3× "
"yomsebenzi we-Low."

#: includes/settings.php:228
msgid "Expiration"
msgstr "Ukuphela kwexesha"

#: includes/settings.php:234
msgid ""
"Life-span of a challenge. Custom accepts 0 to 14400 seconds, where 0 means "
"no expiry (None) and 14400 is 4 hours."
msgstr ""
"Ixesha lokuphila lombuzo. I-Custom yamkela 0 ukuya ku-14400 zee-sekondi, "
"apho 0 kuthetha ukuba akukho kuphela kwexesha (None) kwaye 14400 yiiyure "
"ezine."

#: includes/settings.php:243
msgid "Widget Customisation"
msgstr "Ukulungisa i-Widget"

#: includes/settings.php:250
msgid "Auto verification"
msgstr "Ukuqinisekiswa okuzenzekelayo"

#: includes/settings.php:256
msgid "Select auto-verification behaviour."
msgstr "Khetha indlela yokuqinisekisa okuzenzekelayo."

#: includes/settings.php:258
msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "Icinyiwe"

#: includes/settings.php:259
msgid "On page load"
msgstr "Xa i-page ivuliwe"

#: includes/settings.php:260
msgid "On form focus"
msgstr "Xa kufokuselelwa kwifomu"

#: includes/settings.php:261
msgid "On form submit"
msgstr "Xa uthumela ifomu"

#: includes/settings.php:268
msgid "Display Mode"
msgstr "Imo yoBoniso"

#: includes/settings.php:274
msgid ""
"Choose whether the widget sits inline in the page or floats near the submit "
"button."
msgstr ""
"Khetha ukuba i-widget ihlala i-inline kwi-page okanye i-float kufuphi ne-"
"button yokuthuma."

#: includes/settings.php:276
msgid "Inline"
msgstr "Inline"

#: includes/settings.php:277
msgid "Floating"
msgstr "Floating"

#: includes/settings.php:284
msgid "Verification Delay"
msgstr "Ukulindeleka koQinisekiso"

#: includes/settings.php:293
msgid ""
"Some visitors perceive a slower check as more trustworthy, and that is this "
"pause's only effect. It does not make spam-blocking any stronger; to raise "
"the bar for bots, increase Complexity instead."
msgstr ""
"Abanye abavakasheli babona ukuqinisekisa okucothayo njengokunokuthenjwa "
"ngakumbi, kwaye loo nto yiyo kuphela isiphumo sokumisa oku. Ayikwenzi "
"ukuvalela i-spam kube namandla; ukuze uphakamise imingcele yeebots, yandisa "
"uBunzima endaweni yoko."

#. translators: %s is the added delay in seconds, e.g. "0.5"
#: includes/settings.php:296
#, php-format
msgid "Add %s second delay"
msgstr "Faka ukulindeleka kwe-sekondi %s"

#: includes/settings.php:304
msgid "Acknowledgement"
msgstr "Ukuthetha ngokuthembisa"

#: includes/settings.php:310
msgid ""
"This applies to the small ALTCHA logo shown inside the widget. ALTCHA is "
"free, open-source software — we would appreciate you keeping it visible, but "
"the choice is yours."
msgstr ""
"Oku kusebenza kwi-logo encinci ye-ALTCHA ebonakala ngaphakathi kwe-widget. I-"
"ALTCHA yisoftware yasimahla, evulekileyo — singakuvuyela ukuba uyigcina "
"ibonakala, kodwa isigqibo sisezandleni zakho."

#: includes/settings.php:311
msgid "Hide the ALTCHA logo"
msgstr "Fihla i-logo ye-ALTCHA"

#: includes/settings.php:326
msgid ""
"This applies to the text shown inside the widget. Same as the logo: keeping "
"it visible helps credit the project this plugin is built on, but it has no "
"effect on how OpenPorte works."
msgstr ""
"Oku kusebenza kwiteksti ebonakala ngaphakathi kwe-widget. Njengale logo: "
"ukuyigcina ibonakala kunceda ekunikeni isibonelelo leprojekthi le plugin "
"eyakhiwe kuyo, kodwa ayinasiphumo kwindlela i-OpenPorte esebenza ngayo."

#: includes/settings.php:327
msgid "Hide the \"Protected by ALTCHA\" footer"
msgstr "Fihla i-footer ethi \"Protected by ALTCHA\""

