msgid ""
"OpenPorte is a fork of ALTCHA Spam Protection and cannot run while the "
"original ALTCHA plugin is active — the two share internal code. Please "
"deactivate \"ALTCHA Spam Protection\" first, then activate OpenPorte. See "
"the %s for details."
msgstr ""
"I-OpenPorte yifork ye-ALTCHA Spam Protection kwaye ayinakusebenza ngexesha i-"
"plugin yoqalo ye-ALTCHA isebenza — zombini zabelana ngekhowudi "
"yangaphakathi. Nceda vala i-\"ALTCHA Spam Protection\" kuqala, emva koko "
"uvule i-OpenPorte. Jonga i-%s ukuze ufumane iinkcukacha."

#: openporte.php:66
